    {
      "text": "From the state Housing Element Annual Progress Report, through 2025.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001144",
        "SRC-001145"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CTCAC CA-24-736: Distel Circle, located at 330 Distel Circle in Los Altos on a 0.87 acre site, requested and is being recommended for a reservation of $4,096,134 in annual federal tax credits and $10,431,853 in total state tax credits and $47,511,721 of tax-exempt bond cap to finance the new construction of 90 units of housing, consisting of 88 restricted rental units and 2 unrestricted manager's units.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001656"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Developer page names the project MiLA and lists financing partners 4% LIHTC, Century Housing Corporation, County of Santa Clara, FHLBSF AHP, Housing Accelerator Fund and U.S. Bank; general contractor Nibbi Prefab (modular).",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003078"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "REBusinessOnline (September 2025): County of Santa Clara contribution totals $25 million, including $15.9 million from Measure A, with the balance from the County's No Place Like Home and HOME funds.",
